OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FTrain passengers face further travel
OL,8,Fchaos on Friday morning after a power
OL,9,Foutage ground trains to a halt across
OL,10,Fthe Midlands and north-west England.
OL,12,FElectricity cut out in the main
OL,13,Fcontrol hub for north-west England's
OL,14,Frailways, the Manchester Rail
OL,15,FOperating Centre near Ashburys station
OL,16,Fin the city's east.
OL,18,FThe failure, shortly before 2pm on
OL,19,FThursday, has caused widespread
OL,20,Fcancellations and delays to services.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
