CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786061888
OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FEngineers are making "good progress"
OL,8,Ffixing signalling issues but there
OL,9,Fwill be cancellations for the rest of
OL,10,Fthe night, Network Rail said.
OL,12,FFurther disruption tomorrow is likely
OL,13,Fbecause many trains and their crew
OL,14,F"are not where they would normally be
OL,15,Fafter this unexpected incident", it
OL,16,Fadded.
OL,26,@oD@VOUoD@dO]vD@AOUwD@_O]
