OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786061888
OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FChris Wright, Network Rail's North
OL,8,FWest route director, said: "I'm
OL,9,Fextremely sorry for the disruption
OL,10,Ftoday and the very difficult journeys
OL,11,Fmany people have experienced.
OL,13,F"Our engineers are working tirelessly
OL,14,Fto restore the signalling systems
OL,15,Fimpacted by the power cut at
OL,16,Flunchtime."
OL,26,@pD@\OUuD@AOUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/12
