OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786061888
OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FTrain operators Northern and
OL,8,FTransPennine Express (TPE) advised
OL,9,Fcustomers on Thursday afternoon not to
OL,10,Ftravel, with the latter saying its
OL,11,Ftrains were "unable to run safely"
OL,12,Fbecause of a failure in the
OL,13,Fcommunications systems on the network.
OL,15,FAndrew McClements, customer experience
OL,16,Fand transformation director at TPE,
OL,17,Fsaid "sadly, we're not out of the
OL,18,Fwoods yet" following the "difficult
OL,19,Fincident to manage".
OL,26,@sD@MOUsD@bO]yD@FOUzD@JO]zD@ZOU{D@SO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
