PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786061888
OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,F"I'd urge people to ensure they check
OL,8,FNational Rail Enquiries before they
OL,9,Fset off on any planned journeys
OL,10,Ftomorrow, with further cancellations
OL,11,Fand delays likely", he added.
OL,13,FTPE relaxed ticket restrictions for
OL,14,Fthe whole day, meaning those with
OL,15,Ftickets purchased in advance will be
OL,16,Fable to travel at any time, he said,
OL,17,Fbefore thanking customers for their
OL,18,Fpatience.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/12
