OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FThe chief operating officer of
OL,8,FNorthern apologised to all its
OL,9,Faffected customers.
OL,11,FWarrick Dent said: "We know how
OL,12,Ffrustrating it is to have your journey
OL,13,Fdelayed, cancelled, or disrupted, and
OL,14,FI'm sorry for the impact this has had
OL,15,Fon people's day.
OL,17,F"Our teams have been working hard
OL,18,Falongside Network Rail and other train
OL,19,Foperators to keep customers moving and
OL,20,Finformed throughout.
OL,26,@sD@TOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/12
