OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,F"The scale of today's disruption means
OL,8,Fcustomers travelling through
OL,9,FManchester tomorrow morning should
OL,10,Falso check before they travel, as some
OL,11,Fknock-on delays may continue."
OL,13,FTransport Secretary Heidi Alexander on
OL,14,FThursday afternoon said she is
OL,15,F"receiving regular updates" while
OL,16,FNetwork Rail works to resolve what she
OL,17,Fdescribed as a "power outage".
OL,19,FMs Alexander added: "Disruption is
OL,20,Fexpected during the rest of the day,
OL,21,Fso please check before you travel."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@^O]wD@AOUwD@[O]yD@POUyD@]O]{D@
