OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FThe Manchester facility that
OL,8,Fexperienced the outage was one of 12
OL,9,Foperating centres built to eventually
OL,10,Fmanage the entire British rail
OL,11,Fnetwork, Network Rail said when it
OL,12,Fopened in 2014.
OL,14,FThese facilities replaced 800 signal
OL,15,Fboxes and other operational locations
OL,16,Fthen used to control trains.
OL,18,FIt was planned that the Manchester
OL,19,FRail Operating Centre would control
OL,20,Fall of the railway in north-west
OL,21,FEngland by 2034.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/12
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
