PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786061888
OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FA wartime bomb being discovered near
OL,8,Fthe railway between Tamworth and
OL,9,FBurton-on-Trent also added to the
OL,10,Fdisruption, with all lines blocked,
OL,11,FNational Rail said.
OL,13,FGreater Manchester, the Midlands and
OL,14,Fnorth-west England bore the brunt of
OL,15,Fthe impact.
OL,17,FAn electrical fault at Manchester
OL,18,FPiccadilly also halted trains in April.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/12
