OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FAn extended 12-hour closure of the
OL,8,Frailway was needed for repairs because
OL,9,Fof the "complex area where this took
OL,10,Fplace, with over 400 metres of damaged
OL,11,Flines", Network Rail said at the time.
OL,13,FA National Rail spokesperson said: "If
OL,14,Fyou're travelling Avanti West Coast,
OL,15,FCrossCountry, East Midlands Railway,
OL,16,FLondon Northwestern, Northern,
OL,17,FTransPennine Express, or Transport for
OL,18,FWales in the affected area, your train
OL,19,Fmay be cancelled, delayed, or revised."
OL,26,@qD@HOUsD@FO]uD@dOU{D@gO]
