OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FPassengers and worried relatives
OL,8,Fcontacted National Rail with their
OL,9,Ffrustrations over how to complete
OL,10,Ftheir journeys.
OL,12,FOne passenger, who described
OL,13,Fthemselves as "stranded in Wigan,"
OL,14,Fsaid they needed a replacement bus
OL,15,Fservice as they had to get home for
OL,16,Fchildcare and asked: "Can I reimburse
OL,17,Fa taxi?"
OL,26,@uD@OOUuD@bO]xD@VOUyD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/12
