OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F304A1786061888
OL,3,CRail disruption expected into morning
OL,4,Cafter power outage grinds trains to
OL,5,Chalt
OL,7,FAnother traveller, who was stuck in
OL,8,FManchester, said it had been "chaos at
OL,9,FPiccadilly", while concern about his
OL,10,Fpregnant wife who was in Manchester
OL,11,Fprompted another man to ask how she
OL,12,Fwould be able to get to Lytham St
OL,13,FAnnes amid the train cancellations.
OL,15,FAnother man wrote that their partner,
OL,16,Fa "single female alone", was "stuck in
OL,17,FLiverpool", after leaving Scunthorpe
OL,18,Fand asked, "Can you provide an update
OL,19,Fon how she should get home?"
